See `docs/briefs/` for swarm state, backlog, and grounding health.

## PowerShell Rules
- NEVER use here-strings (@'...'@ or @"..."@) interactively — they hang waiting for the terminator
- NEVER pipe into [System.IO.File]::WriteAllText() — use a variable first
- For multi-line file writes: always use Python, not PowerShell
- For single-line edits: use $c = (Get-Content ...); [IO.File]::WriteAllText(...) pattern
- Set-Content always adds BOM — use [System.IO.File]::WriteAllText with UTF8Encoding($false) or Python

